/**
 * Daily saved-card health sweep (see lib/card-health.ts for the why and the
 * logic). Default OFF: Setting `card_health_sweep_mode` = off | report | enforce.
 *
 * Ticks every 10 min but only does work (a) while a cycle is mid-way (resumable,
 * capped per run), (b) once per UTC day from CARD_HEALTH_QUIET_HOUR_UTC (default
 * 03), or (c) when an admin pressed "Run sweep now" (Setting card_health_run_now).
 * Stripe calls are READ-ONLY `paymentMethods.retrieve`, sequential, 400 ms apart.
 * Never emails a customer: enforce only calls markPaymentMethodUnusable and the
 * existing billing ladder / Billing-page banner take it from there.
